# \ opens the attachments panel of the focused block, Ctrl+\ its context menu, and g| opens the block zoomed in a new pane.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Book hotel
		- Compare prices
END
keys j \
see No note
see No comments
keys <Esc> <C-\>
see Commands:
keys <Esc> g|
see │  󰋜 › Trip › Book hotel
see - Compare prices
quit
